// Ch11 B11 "Held. By you now." (E, 1.5 min). V08: the Vey's mouth at late afternoon. Asha stops beside Pell.
// She doesn't ask about his day. Pell answers a scene later. V09: Rhen and Liss's places in the line depend
// on the lamp bench.
title: ch11_held_by_you
location: ch11/sunken_vey
---
// M4-CIN-1304 (cinematics): staged from act2_ch11_direction.md (shots and marks in game/data/cutscene/ch11/).
@mark pell landing_pell
@camera V08
@music sunken_vey fade=2.0
@mark asha landing_asha walk
@wait 2.0
Asha [grief]: I didn't know. Pell. If I'd known— #line:ch11_held_001
Pell [neutral]: She is not lifted. She is held. #line:ch11_held_002
@wait 2.0
Pell [sad]: By you, now. #line:ch11_held_003
Asha [sad]: ...Do you want me to let her go? #line:ch11_held_004
Pell [neutral]: You cannot. Not yet. #line:ch11_held_005
@wait 1.5
@camera V09
<<if $ch11_lamp_repaired>>
    @mark rhen line_back_a walk
    @mark liss line_back_b walk
<<else>>
    @mark rhen line_back_a walk
    @mark liss line_front walk
<<endif>>
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch11_complete = true>>
@camera release
===
